                                                "example_id": "36532e37-f7b0-45fd-bc0b-e3da600faf59",
                                                "sense_id": "44ec9ff8-1e3d-3645-b1ea-37bef991258d",
                                                "text": "When she cooked, she reached out for bottles and masalas without glancing up."
